{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The hook</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hand-me-downs is a roguelike deck builder where your opponents use your own cards against you, so you need to carefully consider what to play each round.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your opponents don't have their own deck, so they borrow your cards!  <br>Each time you play a hand, your opponent takes the cards from your hand and uses them against you the next time you meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/1234bdb44222df656b277b14a5855cfd.poster.avif?t=1756050482\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/1234bdb44222df656b277b14a5855cfd.webm?t=1756050482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/1234bdb44222df656b277b14a5855cfd.mp4?t=1756050482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The vibes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Immerse yourself in this little slice of Adriatic culture as the gorgeous pixelated versions of the Triestine cards trigger to the beat of traditional Mediterranean music.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Played cards go to the battlefield, rhythmically triggering in order of their priority. The same set of cards can yield vastly different scores under different priority rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/12f102b84ba1b35b8434f933bb62acb9.poster.avif?t=1756050482\" width=780 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/12f102b84ba1b35b8434f933bb62acb9.webm?t=1756050482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/12f102b84ba1b35b8434f933bb62acb9.mp4?t=1756050482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The spice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Lady luck may be your ally or your foe, but nothing she might throw at you can stifle a true master of strategy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The suit priority has the most influence on overall card priority.  <br>It's randomized each round to keep things fresh between opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/2413f32a3c9bff986baa8601a96bd388.poster.avif?t=1756050482\" width=580 height=580 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/2413f32a3c9bff986baa8601a96bd388.webm?t=1756050482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/2413f32a3c9bff986baa8601a96bd388.mp4?t=1756050482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The charm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Each</strong> <strong>suit has its own flavor, and each rank its unique character.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Triestine cards may not be familiar to many, but they certainly don't lack in personality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Throughout the game you'll get familiar with the\u00a0no-nonsense <i><strong>Bastoni</strong></i>, the fortunate <i><strong>Danari</strong></i>, the\u00a0jolly <i><strong>Coppe</strong></i> and the ruthless <i><strong>Spade</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The counterpart to the more familiar <strong>Jack</strong>, <strong>Queen</strong>, and <strong>King</strong> are respectively the <i><strong>Fante</strong></i>, <i><strong>Caval</strong></i>, and\u00a0<i><strong>Re.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Figuring out the numbered ranks and the aces is left as an exercise to the reader.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/276605d3823731abb0e50dd3382a77f8.avif?t=1756050482\" width=1560 height=601 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Each opponent brings a unique twist to the table, so be careful which cards you let them have.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Most opponents you encounter are too prideful to simply use the cards you hand down to them without applying their own touch first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether it's the <strong>The Brush</strong>\u00a0changing the suits, or<strong> The Ladder</strong>\u00a0ranking the cards up, your opponents will make sure to complicate your plans, and provide deck-fixing opportunities to those skillful enough to manipulate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After all, their cards are<i> <strong>your</strong></i>\u00a0cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/08d19607c441b39a12a4de3eae18dd44.poster.avif?t=1756050482\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/08d19607c441b39a12a4de3eae18dd44.webm?t=1756050482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/08d19607c441b39a12a4de3eae18dd44.mp4?t=1756050482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The plea</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>So sit back, relax, take in the sounds of our coast, decimate your opponents, and please don't tell our grandpas how we massacred their game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/901c795897fe342f79bc975c02c220a7.poster.avif?t=1756050482\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/901c795897fe342f79bc975c02c220a7.webm?t=1756050482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/901c795897fe342f79bc975c02c220a7.mp4?t=1756050482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870620?t=1756050482","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870620?t=1756050482","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/c8170acf0a1574314f853746eb4cee56328117b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756050482","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/c8170acf0a1574314f853746eb4cee56328117b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756050482","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The hook</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hand-me-downs is a roguelike deck builder where your opponents use your own cards against you, so you need to carefully consider what to play each round.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your opponents don't have their own deck, so they borrow your cards!  <br>Each time you play a hand, your opponent takes the cards from your hand and uses them against you the next time you meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/1234bdb44222df656b277b14a5855cfd.poster.avif?t=1756050482\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870620/extras/1234bdb44222df656b277b14a5855cfd.webm?t=1756050482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam